---
// Academic & Regulatory Disclaimer (/disclaimer)
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import DocHead from '../components/ui/DocHead.astro';
import { portfolioDisclaimer } from '../data/valuation-models';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Disclaimer | Truong Huy Research"
  description="Academic portfolio disclaimer for the valuation models and market notes on truonghuyresearch.xyz."
>
  <div class="doc">
    <DocHead
      label="Academic Portfolio · Important Disclosures"
      title="Research &amp; Portfolio Disclaimer"
      lead={portfolioDisclaimer}
      back={{ href: '/', label: 'Home' }}
    />
    <section class="ground-surface">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="sheet sheet--accent stack-4 measure">
          <span class="eyebrow">Terms of Use &amp; Analytical Limitations</span>
          <p>
            <strong>1. Personal Academic Work:</strong> All financial models, valuation reports, tear sheets, market notes, and equity research published on <code>truonghuyresearch.xyz</code> are personal academic and portfolio demonstration work prepared by Nguyen Vu Truong Huy. They do not represent the views, official positions, or investment strategies of any current or past employer, university, or institution.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>2. Point-in-Time Valuation Figures:</strong> Company valuation outputs and reference share prices are as of the specific model date shown on each report and workbook (11 June 2026) and are not refreshed automatically with live market quotes. Implied upside or downside percentages compare exclusively against those model-date prices.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>3. Automated Market Data &amp; Language Model Assistance:</strong> Weekly and monthly market notes are drafted with the assistance of automated Python data-collection pipelines and a language model, with frontmatter figures enforced against recorded market data. Any metric shown as a dash (—) was unavailable from primary sources at publication time.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>4. No Investment Advice:</strong> Nothing on this website constitutes financial, legal, tax, or investment advice, nor a recommendation or solicitation to buy, hold, or sell any security. Readers must independently verify every assumption, date, market figure, and Excel formula before relying on any material here for analysis or decision-making.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
